<title>USA: IMH Assets files $500 mln shelf.</title>
<headline>IMH Assets files $500 mln shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>IMH Assets Corp, a unit of Imperial Credit Mortgage Holdings Inc, on Friday filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $500 million in collateralized mortgage bonds.</p>
<p>When combined with a previous registration, IMH will have a total offering of $740,186,081 in bonds available for sale.</p>
<p>The company is based in Santa Ana Heights, Calif.</p>
</text>
